{"name":"Calla","hex":"#f2dfb5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Calla","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A taxonomic genus within the family Araceae – the calla, native to the cool temperate regions of the northern hemisphere."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Calla"}],"entries":[{"title":"Calla","blocks":[{"text":"Calla is a genus of flowering plant in the family Araceae, containing the single species Calla palustris. It is the only genus in the tribe Calleae of the subfamily Aroideae. Its systematic position has been described as \"puzzling\", and it has also been placed in its own family Callaceae and its own subfamily Calloideae."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Calla_palustris2.jpg/330px-Calla_palustris2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calla"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Illustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg/500px-Illustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Illustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg/1280px-Illustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Illustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg/500px-Illustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIllustration_Calla_palustris_clean.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}